1
00:00:00,230 --> 00:00:02,420
ZAMIN FK da katta o‘zgarishlar!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:06,164
Endi bizda nafaqat klub, balki haqiqiy jamoa ham bor!

3
00:00:06,384 --> 00:00:09,833
Paxtakorning ikkinchi jamoasiga qarshi maydonga tushdik.

4
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:11,927
Afsuski, bu safar mag‘lub bo‘ldik.

5
00:00:12,147 --> 00:00:15,675
Lekin bu o‘yinda tariximizdagi ilk golimizni ham urdik!

6
00:00:15,675 --> 00:00:16,958
Bu hali boshlanishi!

7
00:00:17,178 --> 00:00:20,000
Yoshlar akademiyamizning birinchi menejeri ham aniqlandi!

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,877
@yusup_maxamadov, tabriklaymiz!

9
00:00:23,097 --> 00:00:26,314
Mana ular — ZAMIN FK ning haqiqiy tarkibi!

10
00:00:28,134 --> 00:00:30,150
Va zaxiradagi o‘yinchilarimiz!

11
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:35,913
Bu hali boshlanishi!

12
00:00:35,913 --> 00:00:38,328
ZAMIN FK endi birgalikda qurilmoqda.

13
00:00:38,328 --> 00:00:41,549
Siz ham bizning tariximizning bir qismi bo‘ling!

14
00:00:41,769 --> 00:00:43,790
Siz qaysi pozitsiyada o‘ynaysiz?

15
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:44,674
Izohga yozing!

